159 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (MATCHES run on a 15 to 20 minute cycle time per FIELD, which consists of pre-MATCH setup, a minute long AUTO period, a 15-second transition period between AUTO and TELEOP, and an 11-minute TELEOP period consisting of 5 cycles of driving, sorting and parking, followed by the post-MATCH reset. During the MATCH, ROBOTS collect ARTIFACTS and score them into their GOAL to CLASSIFY and create the randomly selected MOTIF. ROBOTS can then open their GATE to continue CLASSIFYING additional ARTIFACTS. ARTIFACTS which do not drop into the RAMP will count as OVERFLOW. ROBOTS conclude the MATCH by returning to their BASE. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
